  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sector: Agriculture.Beneficiaries: 166 farmers.Description: Nchena Livestock Cooperative is seeking funding to build livestock housing, procure livestock, grow crops under drip irrigation, drill a borehole, conduct trainings on nutrition, livestock production and good crop husbandry and to manage operations of their cooperative.</narrative>
